## 1. About Zona and Noble Mace Ventures

Zona is a mobile application that helps users in India — primarily in Rajasthan and Haryana — access publicly available land and property information from official government sources, along with proprietary tools we have built on top of that data.

Zona is operated by **Noble Mace Ventures**, a sole proprietorship registered at 93, Subhash Nagar, NEB, Alwar, Rajasthan, 301001, India. Noble Mace Ventures also operates a separate application called **LandInvest**, which has its own privacy policy.

This Privacy Policy applies only to the Zona application.

## 2. Information We Collect

